*.pbxproj -text
# specific for windows script files
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Vendored native binaries are committed inline (not Git LFS). GitHub's
# public-fork policy blocks LFS object uploads, so the static archives and
# xcframework Mach-O binaries that ship in third-party/ios/ have to live in
# the git pack directly. `!filter !merge !diff` explicitly clears the LFS
# attributes — without that, an inherited or accidentally re-added
# `filter=lfs` would re-engage the smudge/clean filters and break future
# checkouts.
*.a              !text !filter !merge !diff
*.so             !text !filter !merge !diff
**/ExecutorchLib !text !filter !merge !diff
**/opencv2       !text !filter !merge !diff
